Lyntin is a feature-rich mud client and agent development environment,
with an emphasis on extensibility and automation.  Lyntin targets
hacker types as users.

general features
================

 - command-line, tk, and other interfaces
 - multiple sessions
 - actions, aliases, gags, substitutes,
 - grepping previous mud output,
 - variables and pattern matching
 - history
 - logging
 - ticker

features for hackers
========================

 - A standard library of Python modules including an event scheduler
 - Dozens of emacs-style hooks for responding to internal events
 - An init file for setting up your own python environment
 - Easy integration of your code with Lyntin
 - Module and UI extension hooks
